I have just thought of a good trick to avoid this.  It's so obvious I
wonder why I never thought of it before... (And this is after 5 years
of playing Hack!)

Lock the dog in a small room, or a dead-end corridor, or whatever.

Exlpore the level at leisure.  Then go back and get him to go down a
level.  Saves all the food.  You do have to be careful to keep him fed
(if you want him, it's ususally of no concern to me whether he starves
or not...)

